        "title": "Availability & Shipping",
        "subtitle": "",
        "text": "<p>Umbra Ceramics currently ships within&nbsp;Europe.</p><p>If you are located outside Europe and would like to purchase a piece, please get in touch at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:info@umbra-ceramics.com\">info@umbra-ceramics.com</a>and I will check whether shipping is possible and what the associated costs would be.</p><p>Shipping costs and estimated delivery times will be shown before completing your purchase.</p><p>Please note that international orders may be subject to customs duties, taxes or other charges depending on the destination country. These costs, where applicable, are the responsibility of the customer.</p>",
